      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCSET001-0002",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "本细则适用于 DEMO-BANK 各级机构为**单位客户**办理的人民币结算账户业务，包括基本存款账户、一般存款账户、专用存款账户与临时存款账户。",
      "quoteHash": "3aeb75232415138ba8dfc90a49a8d3cf0a9d5292db9f4d78c45bbae09fc36c99",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "1a0c6d4f6de7fcd468ffd8224954484d13a020e65b4d73198f98c19ebf86ead3",
      "sourceId": "SRC-SET-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-SET-001.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCSET001-20260922-1a0c6d4f",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "ELIGIBILITY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCSET001-64732e3e",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-415977d1",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCSET001-0005",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第五条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "客户申请开立单位结算账户，应当同时满足：一、依法登记并存续；二、已完成本行客户身份识别与受益所有人识别；三、不存在本行名单类管控限制；四、开户用途与经营需要相符。",
      "quoteHash": "64732e3e0cd3d299f727e2c00e70d5a885b6e69c50ac359ea3ede78f15fe74cb",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "1a0c6d4f6de7fcd468ffd8224954484d13a020e65b4d73198f98c19ebf86ead3",
      "sourceId": "SRC-SET-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-SET-001.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCSET001-20260922-1a0c6d4f",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "PROCESS",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCSET001-87bf47c2",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-415977d1",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCSET001-0006",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第六条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "客户应在**注册地或经营地**开立账户；确有异地开户需要的，按本行异地开户管理规定办理，并留存说明材料。",
      "quoteHash": "87bf47c2bd5206f6b57fb6877058a10b349c6e981b7c33f49e067985d2031247",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "1a0c6d4f6de7fcd468ffd8224954484d13a020e65b4d73198f98c19ebf86ead3",
      "sourceId": "SRC-SET-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-SET-001.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCSET001-20260922-1a0c6d4f",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "PROCESS",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCSET001-4fe2580e",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-415977d1",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCSET001-0008",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第八条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "单位客户开立基本存款账户应提交：一、营业执照或其他登记证明文件；二、法定代表人或单位负责人身份证件；三、授权他人办理的授权委托书及被授权人身份证件；四、受益所有人身份信息与股权（控制）结构材料；五、预留签章及相关授权文件。",
      "quoteHash": "4fe2580e81b8d12b93429a3a5b0f7e49848be99f28abaef552735079d45be3c3",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "1a0c6d4f6de7fcd468ffd8224954484d13a020e65b4d73198f98c19ebf86ead3",
      "sourceId": "SRC-SET-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-SET-001.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCSET001-20260922-1a0c6d4f",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "PROCESS",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCSET001-0bc119b6",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-415977d1",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCSET001-0010",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "开立临时存款账户应提交临时机构设立批文或临时经营活动的证明材料；用于注册验资的，按专门流程受理并标注用途限制。",
      "quoteHash": "0bc119b60e69c2fa1e59cc069dacdbfd9ca66bcb9cbe7ef68c4fac0c8e2f0b41",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "1a0c6d4f6de7fcd468ffd8224954484d13a020e65b4d73198f98c19ebf86ead3",
      "sourceId": "SRC-SET-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-SET-001.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCSET001-20260922-1a0c6d4f",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "PROCESS",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCSET001-a2fcb737",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-415977d1",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCSET001-0013",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十三条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "对**单位银行结算账户**实行**年检**制度：每年至少核对一次客户登记信息、受益所有人信息与账户实际用途；信息变更的，督促客户及时办理变更。",
      "quoteHash": "a2fcb737ab26325b343214a655431718dfc5c88dd3a582fb61f47cefc95627d4",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "1a0c6d4f6de7fcd468ffd8224954484d13a020e65b4d73198f98c19ebf86ead3",
      "sourceId": "SRC-SET-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-SET-001.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCSET001-20260922-1a0c6d4f",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "PROCESS",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCSET001-bfba7a9f",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-415977d1",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCSET001-0018",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十八条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "久悬管理：对连续**一年**未发生收付活动且未欠本行债务的单位账户，本行应通知客户办理销户；通知后**三十日**内未办理的，转入久悬账户管理并限制支付功能。",
      "quoteHash": "bfba7a9f2065c3526956114230cec9fa4d0f01468dcaa715efebd2f3d503a620",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T19:10:00+08:00",
